# Build context of shelfy-api.Dockerfile: BuildKit reads this file instead of a
# root .dockerignore. Only what the image needs goes in: the Cargo workspace
# without its tests, the AI prompts and schemas it embeds (shared/ai/), and the
# built web app.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!shared/ai/
!web/dist/
crates/*/tests/
shared/ai/fixtures/
crates/*/examples/
crates/*/benches/
crates/server/openapi.json
**/target/
**/.DS_Store
